<view class="page with-footer"><load-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bind:retry="reload"/><block wx:if="{{preview}}"><view class="panel row"><image class="summary-image" src="{{preview.product.coverUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view class="heading">{{preview.product.name}} · {{preview.product.breed}}</view><view class="caption">{{preview.product.ageMonths}}个月 · {{preview.product.genderText}}</view><view class="brand">参考价 {{preview.priceText}}</view></view></view><view class="notice">预约不收款 · 提交后等待门店确认。</view><view class="panel"><view class="heading">联系信息</view><view class="field"><text class="label">联系人</text><input class="input" placeholder="请填写本人姓名" maxlength="30" value="{{contactName}}" data-field="contactName" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">手机号</text><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请填写到店联系号码" value="{{contactPhone}}" data-field="contactPhone" bindinput="input"/><text class="caption">仅用于到店联系，不用于登录或绑定微信账号。</text></view></view><view class="panel"><view class="heading">选择到店时间</view><view class="field"><text class="label">日期（北京时间）</text><picker mode="date" start="{{minDate}}" end="{{maxDate}}" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date"><view class="input">{{date || '选择未来 7 天内的日期'}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" bindchange="time"><view class="input">{{time}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view class="caption">营业时间：{{preview.shop.businessHours}}</view><view class="caption">{{preview.shop.pickupInstructions}}</view></view><view class="panel"><text class="label">预约备注（选填）</text><textarea class="input" maxlength="500" value="{{remark}}" data-field="remark" bindinput="input" placeholder="想提前告诉店长的事情…"/></view><button class="text-btn" bindtap="readAgreement">阅读预约须知与风险说明 →</button><checkbox-group bindchange="accept"><label class="check"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{accepted}}" color="#B9512B"/><text>我已阅读并同意预约须知与风险说明</text></label></checkbox-group><view class="caption">每个账号限 1 个有效预约。以门店确认为准。</view><view class="demo-note" wx:if="{{demo}}"></view></block></view><view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="footer"><button class="btn" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting || loading || !accepted || !preview.purchaseAllowed}}">{{submitting ? '正在提交…' : '提交到店预约'}}</button></view>
